ffer between the\n  two runs are highlighted.\n- Given runs produced by Data Science Pipelines, when they are included in a\n  comparison, then their parameters and metrics render correctly through the\n  existing run data surfaces without changes to Data Science Pipelines\n  (passive-component validation).\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-1 (P0): users can select two or more runs and view their parameters and\n  metrics side by side in the Dashboard — primary coverage.\n- HLR-3 (P1): run \"diff\" view highlighting which parameters and metrics\n  changed between two selected runs — consolidated with HLR-1: the diff view\n  is a presentation mode of the same comparison surface over the same run\n  data, so both requirements are covered by this single epic at the higher\n  priority.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":30407,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9286ec9cdda3dfcb","agent_id":"aa1e37490745d1917","session_id":"3c02bfff-ea55-4ad3-8ee9-33ea5d892dc0","uuid":"99b74761-311d-428c-aa9d-955af7fef763","timestamp":"2026-10-23T19:38:21.089Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9015"}
