 Pipelines is in scope.\n50\t  Correct rendering of pipeline-run data in the comparison is the\n51\t  keep-working validation for that passively affected component.\n52\t- Out of scope: automatic best-run selection or promotion, and comparison\n53\t  across clusters or across projects.\n54\t\n55\t## Acceptance Criteria\n56\t\n57\t- Given a list of runs, when the user selects two or more runs and opens the\n58\t  comparison, then the parameters and metrics of every selected run are\n59\t  displayed side by side.\n60\t- Given two runs selected in the comparison view, when the diff presentation\n61\t  is opened, then the parameters and metrics whose values differ between the\n62\t  two runs are highlighted.\n63\t- Given runs produced by Data Science Pipelines, when they are included in a\n64\t  comparison, then their parameters and metrics render correctly through the\n65\t  existing run data surfaces without changes to Data Science Pipelines\n66\t  (passive-component validation).\n67\t\n68\t## HLR Traceability\n69\t\n70\t- HLR-1 (P0): users can select two or more runs and view their parameters and\n71\t  metrics side by side in the Dashboard — primary coverage.\n72\t- HLR-3 (P1): run \"diff\" view highlighting which parameters and metrics\n73\t  changed between two selected runs — consolidated with HLR-1: the diff view\n74\t  is a presentation mode of the same comparison surface over the same run\n75\t  data, so both requirements are covered by this single epic at the higher\n76\t  priority.\n77\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9a3d88c4fa8e738b","agent_id":"a8d4eed577412873a","session_id":"3c02bfff-ea55-4ad3-8ee9-33ea5d892dc0","uuid":"56ac61eb-0bd9-464b-bbb7-d1631d75ebe6","timestamp":"2026-10-23T19:40:17.318Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8092077086f1af45","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9015 decomposition"}
